      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ITALIAN DANCER (2) comes through stronger racing and strips rock-hard fit now. Has a strong association with the 2kg claimer who reunites. With good early toe, expect them to push the button from the wide alley and run them along. AWAYGOESTHEBUNNY (4) was beaten as a well-supported favourite in Open company last start but is a track-and-trip winner and has been close enough in recent runs to stay right in the mix. FLYING BAT (1) has consecutive placings on the course proper and will be injecting plenty of speed into the race from the low draw. Apel's 2kg claim gets him in well at the weights and he's another that deserves respect. HULKAMANIA (7) is yet to hit his straps this campaign but has trialled well between runs and and gets in light with the 3kg claimer engaged. Keeping him safe for a minor spot.",
